<div class="auth-shell">
  <aside class="auth-visual" aria-label="CALIDRO RACS introduction">
    <a class="auth-brand-lockup" href="/"><img src="/images/LOGO/RACS.png" alt="" class="auth-brand-mark"><span class="auth-brand-copy"><strong>CALIDRO RACS</strong><small>Service Booking Management</small></span></a>
    <div class="auth-visual-content"><span class="auth-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i> Google verified</span><h2>Almost ready to book.</h2><p>Add your contact details and service address to finish creating your account.</p></div>
  </aside>
  <main class="auth-form-panel">
    <div class="auth-form-card" style="width:min(100%,820px)">
      <header class="auth-form-card-header"><span class="auth-page-kicker">Finish Google signup</span><h1 class="auth-form-card-title">Complete your profile</h1><p class="auth-form-card-subtitle">Google verified <strong><%= email %></strong>. Your profile details help us arrange service.</p></header>
      <form id="google-signup-form" novalidate>
        <div class="auth-field-row">
          <div class="auth-field"><label class="auth-field-label" for="google-firstName">First name</label><input class="auth-field-input" id="google-firstName" name="firstName" value="<%= firstName %>" maxlength="20" autocomplete="given-name" required></div>
          <div class="auth-field"><label class="auth-field-label" for="google-lastName">Last name</label><input class="auth-field-input" id="google-lastName" name="lastName" value="<%= lastName %>" maxlength="20" autocomplete="family-name" required></div>
        </div>
        <div class="auth-field"><label class="auth-field-label" for="google-phone">Mobile number</label><input class="auth-field-input" id="google-phone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="15" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="09171234567" required></div>
        <fieldset class="auth-fieldset"><legend>Service address</legend>
          <div class="auth-field-row">
            <div class="auth-field"><label class="auth-field-label" for="register-addressProvince">Province</label><select class="auth-field-input" id="register-addressProvince" name="addressProvince" required><option value="">Select province</option></select></div>
            <div class="auth-field"><label class="auth-field-label" for="register-addressCity">City or municipality</label><select class="auth-field-input" id="register-addressCity" name="addressCity" disabled required><option value="">Select city</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div class="auth-field-row">
            <div class="auth-field"><label class="auth-field-label" for="register-addressBarangay">Barangay</label><select class="auth-field-input" id="register-addressBarangay" name="addressBarangay" disabled required><option value="">Select barangay</option></select></div>
            <div class="auth-field"><label class="auth-field-label" for="register-addressPostal">Postal code</label><input class="auth-field-input" id="register-addressPostal" name="addressPostal" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="4" required></div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <label class="auth-check auth-terms"><input type="checkbox" name="termsAccepted" required><span class="auth-check-box" aria-hidden="true"><i class="bi bi-check-lg"></i></span><span>I agree to the <button class="auth-text-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#termsModal">Terms and Conditions</button>.</span></label>
        <p class="text-danger small d-none" id="google-signup-error" role="alert"></p>
        <button type="submit" class="auth-submit" id="google-signup-submit"><span class="btn-text">Create account with Google</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        <p class="auth-submit-note">Use Google to sign in next time. You can set a password later through Forgot password.</p>
      </form>
      <p class="auth-toggle-text">Wrong Google account? <a class="auth-toggle-link" href="/api/auth/google">Choose another account</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
<div class="modal fade auth-terms-modal" id="termsModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="termsModalLabel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><h2 class="modal-title" id="termsModalLabel">Terms and Conditions</h2><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button></div><div class="modal-body"><p>Provide accurate contact and service-address information and use the platform only for legitimate service requests.</p><p>Keep your account secure and contact CALIDRO RACS if you believe it has been compromised.</p></div><div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="auth-secondary-button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button></div></div></div></div>
